cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OncoTranscript-TNBC in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "OncoTranscript-TNBC: Transcriptomic Signatures of Aggressive Triple-Negative Breast Cancer"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2024-11-12
url: "https://github.com/lokaaaaaaa/oncotranscript-tnbc-v2"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lokaaaaaaa/oncotranscript-tnbc-v2"
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "Loka Veena Sri D."
    email: "dlokaveenasri@gmail.com"
    github: "lokaaaaaaa"
keywords:
  - TNBC
  - breast cancer
  - RNA-seq
  - DESeq2
  - Nextflow
  - machine learning
  - biomarker discovery
  - TCGA-BRCA
abstract: >
  OncoTranscript-TNBC is a reproducible Nextflow DSL2 pipeline that identifies
  transcriptional and immune-pathway signatures distinguishing triple-negative
  breast cancer (TNBC) from hormone-receptor-positive disease using TCGA-BRCA
  as discovery and GSE58135 as independent validation. It integrates STAR
  alignment, DESeq2 differential expression, clusterProfiler GSEA, and a
  Random Forest biomarker classifier achieving validation AUROC of 0.87.
